spice
* SPICE netlist for the schematic

* Voltage Sources
Vb1 A 0 DC ...  ; Specify voltage as needed
Vb2 B 0 DC ...
Vb3 C 0 DC ...
Vb4 D 0 DC ...
Vinp E 0 DC ...
VDD 4 0 DC ...

* Transistors
M1 3  E  3  3 NMOS 
M2 B  A  3  3 NMOS 
M3 2  B  2  2 NMOS 
M4 C  2  3  3 NMOS
M5 4  2  4  4 PMOS 
M6 0  D  0  0 NMOS 

* Capacitor
Ccomp 2 2 ...

* End of netlist